<!doctype lake><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="fixed" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><h2 data-lake-id="M7jk2" id="M7jk2"><span data-lake-id="u5760ae04" id="u5760ae04">框架图</span><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F35409901%2F1793193722819-d3e89162-18c9-465f-87a6-1732050c06c7.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u80af254e-bab8-4b61-88ef-5167f3062c7%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ucc5437f8-9dc8-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A713.6%2C%22height%22%3A367%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22LoadPipe%20level2.drawio.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A90108%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A892%2C%22originHeight%22%3A459%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22META%2CTAGRESP%22%2C%22x%22%3A243%2C%22y%22%3A44%2C%22width%22%3A131%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%224WAYDATA%22%2C%22x%22%3A639%2C%22y%22%3A412%2C%22width%22%3A104%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LOADPIPE%22%2C%22x%22%3A802%2C%22y%22%3A272%2C%22width%22%3A88%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DATAARRAY%22%2C%22x%22%3A520%2C%22y%22%3A422%2C%22width%22%3A90%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LOADUNIT%22%2C%22x%22%3A29%2C%22y%22%3A273%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%224WAYREADREG%22%2C%22x%22%3A337%2C%22y%22%3A404%2C%22width%22%3A146%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WRITEBACK%22%2C%22x%22%3A774%2C%22y%22%3A400%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LOADRED%22%2C%22x%22%3A217%2C%22y%22%3A249%2C%22width%22%3A82%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ISSQUEUE%22%2C%22x%22%3A643%2C%22y%22%3A73%2C%22width%22%3A98%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22METAARRAY%22%2C%22x%22%3A194%2C%22y%22%3A124%2C%22width%22%3A108%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22READALLRE%22%2C%22x%22%3A232%2C%22y%22%3A185%2C%22width%22%3A111%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%91MSSREG%22%2C%22x%22%3A653%2C%22y%22%3A171%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MISS%E4%BA%86%E6%88%B4%E8%80%85%E6%B2%A1%22%2C%22x%22%3A651%2C%22y%22%3A141%2C%22width%22%3A73%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%9C%89META%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%22%2C%22x%22%3A655%2C%22y%22%3A156%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DATA%22%2C%22x%22%3A76%2C%22y%22%3A128%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REPLACE%22%2C%22x%22%3A774%2C%22y%22%3A80%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%96%B0%E6%9B%BF%E6%8D%A2%22%2C%22x%22%3A769%2C%22y%22%3A119%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NEEDREPLACE%22%2C%22x%22%3A533%2C%22y%22%3A252%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QUEUE%22%2C%22x%22%3A780%2C%22y%22%3A426%2C%22width%22%3A77%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TAGARRA%22%2C%22x%22%3A291%2C%22y%22%3A124%2C%22width%22%3A84%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TAGMATCH%22%2C%22x%22%3A438%2C%22y%22%3A258%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22METACHECK%22%2C%22x%22%3A537%2C%22y%22%3A275%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REPLAY%22%2C%22x%22%3A70%2C%22y%22%3A81%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TLB%22%2C%22x%22%3A488%2C%22y%22%3A112%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HITMISS%22%2C%22x%22%3A500%2C%22y%22%3A299%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PA%22%2C%22x%22%3A507%2C%22y%22%3A172%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%22%2C%22x%22%3A772%2C%22y%22%3A136%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22S1%22%2C%22x%22%3A504%2C%22y%22%3A274%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22S2%22%2C%22x%22%3A669%2C%22y%22%3A275%2C%22width%22%3A20%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%92%8C%22%2C%22x%22%3A74%2C%22y%22%3A101%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22S0%22%2C%22x%22%3A349%2C%22y%22%3A250%2C%22width%22%3A22%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f2ec%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ue1b2dde9%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></h2><p data-lake-id="u55de982a" id="u55de982a"><span data-lake-id="u609c10c0" id="u609c10c0">设计的想法是没有 way predict，两级loadpipe流水线。与香山不一样的地方是s1流水线中行为不同，在s1获得物理地址后与4个tag进行比较获得真实way，再拿真实way去访问DataArray。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u9782e3c4" id="u9782e3c4"><strong><span data-lake-id="ucd4d287c" id="ucd4d287c">​</span></strong><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="f0HO3" id="f0HO3"><span data-lake-id="u41976175" id="u41976175">流水行为</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u5dadee24" id="u5dadee24"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf0db5384" id="uf0db5384">s0:</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uf2ad881d" id="uf2ad881d"><span data-lake-id="u05010bf4" id="u05010bf4">在s0阶段，LoadPipe使用虚拟地址发起了Meta和Tag读请求，读的话是读选定的set中的所有way的tag和meta。<br /><br /></span></p><p data-lake-id="uae6d8845" id="uae6d8845"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9aad1ab1" id="u9aad1ab1">s1:</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u4a85561e" id="u4a85561e"><span data-lake-id="ubeab86d3" id="ubeab86d3">在s1阶段，LoadPipe拿到全way的meta，全way的tag和MMU翻译之后的物理地址，此时可以进行tag比较得到真实way，判断hit/miss和一致性权限是否足够。但即使是拿到了真实way了，依旧是访问全部way的dataarray。<br /><br /></span></p><p data-lake-id="u5536bfd8" id="u5536bfd8"><strong><span data-lake-id="u298e967a" id="u298e967a">s2:</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ubc54d839" id="ubc54d839">​</span></p><p data-lake-id="ucc3f0c80" id="ucc3f0c80"><span data-lake-id="u3bcd1b66" id="u3bcd1b66">在s2阶段，拿从s1中判断的出的miss/hit结果和一致性结果，发Missreq请求 或 发hit数据给LoadUnit，更新replace状态。<br /><br /></span></p><h2 data-lake-id="o8WbH" id="o8WbH"><span data-lake-id="u905745d6" id="u905745d6">LoadPipe接口</span></h2><table data-lake-id="ustd9" id="ustd9" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 701px"><colgroup><col width="140"><col width="128"><col width="248"><col width="185"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u406ff0ac" id="u406ff0ac" style="height: 36px"><td data-lake-id="u0ee9fd6e" id="u0ee9fd6e"><p data-lake-id="u6389bbfd" id="u6389bbfd"><span data-lake-id="u2abc3164" id="u2abc3164">字段</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u902aa7e0" id="u902aa7e0"><p data-lake-id="u71f0b72a" id="u71f0b72a"><span data-lake-id="ude3ef5b5" id="ude3ef5b5">方向</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u19c5dcd5" id="u19c5dcd5"><p data-lake-id="ubd0f3054" id="ubd0f3054"><span data-lake-id="u4020b35c" id="u4020b35c">信号</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uf00a1fde" id="uf00a1fde"><p data-lake-id="ua8c71ceb" id="ua8c71ceb"><span data-lake-id="u1811b854" id="u1811b854">说明</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u4b30b34d" id="u4b30b34d"><td data-lake-id="u67c9c6a2" id="u67c9c6a2"><p data-lake-id="u9919bad8" id="u9919bad8"><span data-lake-id="u22253497" id="u22253497">DCacheLoadIO</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u1057893b" id="u1057893b"><p data-lake-id="ub6c4895b" id="ub6c4895b"><span data-lake-id="ue0ad1891" id="ue0ad1891">Flipped</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u397477f5" id="u397477f5"><p data-lake-id="u4cb7d85c" id="u4cb7d85c"><span data-lake-id="u9d44ee71" id="u9d44ee71">lsu</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uebe65841" id="uebe65841"><p data-lake-id="u37938853" id="u37938853"><span data-lake-id="u9df9ccf3" id="u9df9ccf3">DCache和LSU的接口</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ub72947cc" id="ub72947cc"><td data-lake-id="ub7a40d38" id="ub7a40d38"><p data-lake-id="ub5584643" id="ub5584643"><span data-lake-id="u58a073a5" id="u58a073a5">MetaReadReq</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u3c1003d8" id="u3c1003d8"><p data-lake-id="u3254debd" id="u3254debd"><span data-lake-id="u70524128" id="u70524128">DecoupledIO</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u7f9fb75e" id="u7f9fb75e"><p data-lake-id="ub5ae1d00" id="ub5ae1d00"><span data-lake-id="u7601cdf6" id="u7601cdf6">meta_read</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u656b1e02" id="u656b1e02"><p data-lake-id="uee09401c" id="uee09401c"><span data-lake-id="ud3d23ff9" id="ud3d23ff9">读meta请求</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="uc0409151" id="uc0409151"><td data-lake-id="u257ee6c5" id="u257ee6c5"><p data-lake-id="ubb265019" id="ubb265019"><span data-lake-id="ufd7096b5" id="ufd7096b5">Meta</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u0b31a67c" id="u0b31a67c"><p data-lake-id="ufc19e8a5" id="ufc19e8a5"><span data-lake-id="u4c3dc3a5" id="u4c3dc3a5">Input</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uae45d045" id="uae45d045"><p data-lake-id="u5fe47d49" id="u5fe47d49"><span data-lake-id="ucb6d10ce" id="ucb6d10ce">meta_resp</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u4c2aec15" id="u4c2aec15"><p data-lake-id="uff27209e" id="uff27209e"><span data-lake-id="ucee727cb" id="ucee727cb">一致性信息结果</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u1cfef573" id="u1cfef573"><td data-lake-id="u749f061c" id="u749f061c"><p data-lake-id="ub3e03843" id="ub3e03843"><span data-lake-id="u893fc8d0" id="u893fc8d0">TagReadReq</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ub00d7d0c" id="ub00d7d0c"><p data-lake-id="u02bfef36" id="u02bfef36"><span data-lake-id="ue0fd8363" id="ue0fd8363">DecoupledIO</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u24f02d49" id="u24f02d49"><p data-lake-id="u4d19c48a" id="u4d19c48a"><span data-lake-id="u60ad6ea8" id="u60ad6ea8">tag_read</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u30287be3" id="u30287be3"><p data-lake-id="uf7b1d52d" id="uf7b1d52d"><span data-lake-id="u4d3caa8a" id="u4d3caa8a">读tag请求</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ub1d3a41f" id="ub1d3a41f" style="height: 87px"><td data-lake-id="uf07e9f0d" id="uf07e9f0d"><p data-lake-id="ueac76767" id="ueac76767"><span data-lake-id="ue2b1e929" id="ue2b1e929">Vec(nways, UInt(encTagBits.W))</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ue8aa83a7" id="ue8aa83a7"><p data-lake-id="uce646770" id="uce646770"><span data-lake-id="uc490af9b" id="uc490af9b">Input</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uc1778623" id="uc1778623"><p data-lake-id="u2772aa6a" id="u2772aa6a"><span data-lake-id="ue3401251" id="ue3401251">tag_resp</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u1816b86c" id="u1816b86c"><p data-lake-id="uc69a50e7" id="uc69a50e7"><span data-lake-id="u7f94c82d" id="u7f94c82d">同时读4way出来</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u1a6531fb" id="u1a6531fb"><td data-lake-id="u47dcbd9d" id="u47dcbd9d"><p data-lake-id="ucacf5e8e" id="ucacf5e8e"><span data-lake-id="u8ce18493" id="u8ce18493">L1BankedDataReadReqWithMask</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u55e077cc" id="u55e077cc"><p data-lake-id="u9a930a41" id="u9a930a41"><span data-lake-id="u5b935d38" id="u5b935d38">DecoupledIO</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ua43b7bc1" id="ua43b7bc1"><p data-lake-id="ua4685e2e" id="ua4685e2e"><span data-lake-id="u089ed771" id="u089ed771">banked_data_read</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u1ff08e95" id="u1ff08e95"><p data-lake-id="u4f62fb2e" id="u4f62fb2e"><span data-lake-id="ueec8fc9b" id="ueec8fc9b">只读1way的data请求</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u5cfe1b12" id="u5cfe1b12"><td data-lake-id="u181f269f" id="u181f269f"><p data-lake-id="u01c1431b" id="u01c1431b"><span data-lake-id="ub72da171" id="ub72da171">Bool()</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u390ce7a7" id="u390ce7a7"><p data-lake-id="uf13ed85c" id="uf13ed85c"><span data-lake-id="u8f93a651" id="u8f93a651">Output()</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uc6e05f50" id="uc6e05f50"><p data-lake-id="ub3bfcd8f" id="ub3bfcd8f"><span data-lake-id="uaae3edbe" id="uaae3edbe">is128Req</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u1215fbae" id="u1215fbae"><p data-lake-id="u8ae57423" id="u8ae57423"><span data-lake-id="ue695469c" id="ue695469c">是否需要跨bank读</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u15ddde60" id="u15ddde60"><td data-lake-id="uf1056607" id="uf1056607"><p data-lake-id="u07c88d63" id="u07c88d63"><span data-lake-id="u532779b3" id="u532779b3">Vec(2, new L1BankedDataReadResult())</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u82bb9dbc" id="u82bb9dbc"><p data-lake-id="u01b44b96" id="u01b44b96"><span data-lake-id="u4ff735af" id="u4ff735af">Input</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u784901ef" id="u784901ef"><p data-lake-id="ub70a0f5b" id="ub70a0f5b"><span data-lake-id="uc782413b" id="uc782413b">banked_data_resp</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u638343f9" id="u638343f9"><p data-lake-id="ud3263082" id="ud3263082"><span data-lake-id="u940f7797" id="u940f7797">默认位宽是128bit，不跨bank就只有低64位有效，跨bank就全有效</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u7aae87c8" id="u7aae87c8"><td data-lake-id="u9b484954" id="u9b484954"><p data-lake-id="ud1bd99eb" id="ud1bd99eb"><span data-lake-id="ub2bfc324" id="ub2bfc324">Bool()</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u32b84d21" id="u32b84d21"><p data-lake-id="u8d02cf7e" id="u8d02cf7e"><span data-lake-id="u6d69d9a8" id="u6d69d9a8">Input</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u557c6e86" id="u557c6e86"><p data-lake-id="udc4ba37c" id="udc4ba37c"><span data-lake-id="u0fd34219" id="u0fd34219">bank_conflict</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u2a771900" id="u2a771900"><p data-lake-id="uf019ae25" id="uf019ae25"><span data-lake-id="u59046cd7" id="u59046cd7">表示读bank有冲突</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u61475ddc" id="u61475ddc" style="height: 69px"><td data-lake-id="u7f8125df" id="u7f8125df"><p data-lake-id="u7736e0c7" id="u7736e0c7"><span data-lake-id="uc230a52d" id="uc230a52d">MissReq</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u29bd690f" id="u29bd690f"><p data-lake-id="ue1384b79" id="ue1384b79"><span data-lake-id="u6deeb60b" id="u6deeb60b">DecoupledIO</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="udf83eea3" id="udf83eea3"><p data-lake-id="ufbb1f4c3" id="ufbb1f4c3"><span data-lake-id="ufbcbd1ba" id="ufbcbd1ba">miss_req</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ufb89e47f" id="ufb89e47f"><p data-lake-id="u7d12c0e1" id="u7d12c0e1"><span data-lake-id="u1acec8bc" id="u1acec8bc">发MSHR请求</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u56afbc43" id="u56afbc43"><td data-lake-id="u5b20c845" id="u5b20c845"><p data-lake-id="u9a5b46e6" id="u9a5b46e6"><span data-lake-id="u9066f626" id="u9066f626">MissResp</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u586557dd" id="u586557dd"><p data-lake-id="u43953bff" id="u43953bff"><span data-lake-id="u5abb1bf7" id="u5abb1bf7">Input</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u9bcadd3b" id="u9bcadd3b"><p data-lake-id="u62731129" id="u62731129"><span data-lake-id="ub1ae242c" id="ub1ae242c">miss_resp</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ub0ecdb17" id="ub0ecdb17"><p data-lake-id="u9284de9e" id="u9284de9e"><span data-lake-id="u62cf1da5" id="u62cf1da5">收MSHR数据</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ub4667f08" id="ub4667f08"><td data-lake-id="u3b0e0403" id="u3b0e0403"><p data-lake-id="u8f0a4791" id="u8f0a4791"><span data-lake-id="u62827fee" id="u62827fee">UInt()</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u74ac67c2" id="u74ac67c2"><p data-lake-id="ua704176a" id="ua704176a"><span data-lake-id="u53b9cb7d" id="u53b9cb7d">Valid</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u9800905f" id="u9800905f"><p data-lake-id="u8e1c5d52" id="u8e1c5d52"><span data-lake-id="u179c1f19" id="u179c1f19">wbq_conflict_check</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u99d33684" id="u99d33684"><p data-lake-id="u2a8dea7c" id="u2a8dea7c"><span data-lake-id="u34fa597e" id="u34fa597e">查询下发的这个miss，有没有在WBQ中</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u286a4e20" id="u286a4e20" style="height: 36px"><td data-lake-id="u6e4b4bc2" id="u6e4b4bc2"><p data-lake-id="u30dbac49" id="u30dbac49"><span data-lake-id="u52947a83" id="u52947a83">Bool()</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uffe8a220" id="uffe8a220"><p data-lake-id="u933548b4" id="u933548b4"><span data-lake-id="u71a01c0e" id="u71a01c0e">Input</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u2e1e3202" id="u2e1e3202"><p data-lake-id="u948ef8d0" id="u948ef8d0"><span data-lake-id="ub85cf23f" id="ub85cf23f">wbq_block_miss_req</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uec857377" id="uec857377"><p data-lake-id="u40d2c2c6" id="u40d2c2c6"><span data-lake-id="ua701edb5" id="ua701edb5">如果在要阻塞miss</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u14a1b74c" id="u14a1b74c"><td data-lake-id="u5aa7d832" id="u5aa7d832"><p data-lake-id="uea632968" id="uea632968"><span data-lake-id="u353628b0" id="u353628b0">ReplacementAccessBundle</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u3bf87f17" id="u3bf87f17"><p data-lake-id="ufd324519" id="ufd324519"><span data-lake-id="u34c57fee" id="u34c57fee">ValidIO</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u7f5f9703" id="u7f5f9703"><p data-lake-id="u8f2061d8" id="u8f2061d8"><span data-lake-id="uc0611c21" id="uc0611c21">replace_valid</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u2a912f81" id="u2a912f81"><p data-lake-id="u8adb5be0" id="u8adb5be0"><span data-lake-id="ue99eff05" id="ue99eff05">命中时，让替换策略更新状态</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ua6fc7d6d" id="ua6fc7d6d"><td data-lake-id="u8575eba0" id="u8575eba0"><p data-lake-id="u26e91964" id="u26e91964"><span data-lake-id="u50685269" id="u50685269">Bool()</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u61ca43f7" id="u61ca43f7"><p data-lake-id="u5792550c" id="u5792550c"><span data-lake-id="ue4df6cf9" id="ue4df6cf9">Input</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u2c9aa127" id="u2c9aa127"><p data-lake-id="ucfebb7a7" id="ucfebb7a7"><span data-lake-id="u4c244acc" id="u4c244acc">disable_ld_fast_wakeup</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u5959be3d" id="u5959be3d"><p data-lake-id="u04e59f4c" id="u04e59f4c"><span data-lake-id="uf1757f7a" id="uf1757f7a">不能提前唤醒load</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u4b72d40c" id="u4b72d40c"><td data-lake-id="u50d11707" id="u50d11707"><p data-lake-id="u0fc41d7f" id="u0fc41d7f"><span data-lake-id="u6b97ede5" id="u6b97ede5">(log2 nSets.W)</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u26ec2363" id="u26ec2363"><p data-lake-id="uf7b81ff9" id="uf7b81ff9"><span data-lake-id="ud84a6960" id="ud84a6960">Output</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u65343490" id="u65343490"><p data-lake-id="ub60708c6" id="ub60708c6"><span data-lake-id="ue0934f4f" id="ue0934f4f">unqiue_occupy_set</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ud8907029" id="ud8907029"><p data-lake-id="ua87c6cb9" id="ua87c6cb9"><span data-lake-id="ucba70deb" id="ucba70deb">让MQ检查set的唯一权限事务占用</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ub8ad16a4" id="ub8ad16a4"><td data-lake-id="u02faca53" id="u02faca53"><p data-lake-id="u896b5f95" id="u896b5f95"><span data-lake-id="ucd1f7636" id="ucd1f7636">Bool()</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ud974f738" id="ud974f738"><p data-lake-id="ufd372196" id="ufd372196"><span data-lake-id="ucb0262ac" id="ucb0262ac">Input</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ufd3d139b" id="ufd3d139b"><p data-lake-id="ua2f947b8" id="ua2f947b8"><span data-lake-id="ufa74284f" id="ufa74284f">unique_occupy_fail</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ue9c0c430" id="ue9c0c430"><p data-lake-id="ud009e8a9" id="ud009e8a9"><span data-lake-id="u6fe61a39" id="u6fe61a39">MQ让本次权限升级取消</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="udb15cc77" id="udb15cc77"><span data-lake-id="uab244e9f" id="uab244e9f">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="i7qh6" id="i7qh6"><span data-lake-id="u560d1c2c" id="u560d1c2c">事务描述</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id="xfWU8" id="xfWU8"><span data-lake-id="u4254ff43" id="u4254ff43">非对齐访存</span></h3><p data-lake-id="u3298de22" id="u3298de22"><span data-lake-id="u1b4d5ab1" id="u1b4d5ab1">香山还有个跨16B访存得分成两条访存事务，不是很清楚啥原因，YQH不加这个feature。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ucf776be2" id="ucf776be2"><span data-lake-id="u76003f31" id="u76003f31">目前的访存是按照1个bank 8B的颗粒度来访问的，如果说遇到地址没对齐的访存，可以使用is128Req来辅助跨bank读取数据，然后截取其中一部分给LSU。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua8a3b26d" id="ua8a3b26d"><span data-lake-id="uef1e7f44" id="uef1e7f44">​</span><br></p><h3 data-lake-id="Geibe" id="Geibe"><span data-lake-id="u7d50f31a" id="u7d50f31a">权限升级取消</span></h3><p data-lake-id="ud63d549c" id="ud63d549c"><span data-lake-id="uaaa0a7a0" id="uaaa0a7a0">LoadPipe如果要申请UC权限(SC的情况下写预取)，需要向MissQueue申请MSHR。如果说 同一个set的所有way在权限升级中，会导致如果后续产生了miss，由于权限升级不能有victim，于是不能替换出去。于是香山的做法就是同一个set中最多只能有way-1条升级权限请求能成功，真miss的时候就能选中这条way作为victim。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue78c08d2" id="ue78c08d2"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u2b215edf" id="u2b215edf"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id="KTToh" id="KTToh"><span data-lake-id="u8f19c47a" id="u8f19c47a">查询WriteBack的Block</span></h3><p data-lake-id="ud48108b6" id="ud48108b6"><span data-lake-id="uaa8be100" id="uaa8be100">一条miss的load指令loadpipe在s2级流水线要访问WBQ，如果这条mmiss的物理行地址在WBQ中，也就是如果本次的miss已经在写回中，就不允许发出MissReq了。</span></p>